Subject: [PATCH] [GH#569] Analog: Add STM32C0 ADC driver

Signed-off-by: Gerson Fernando Budke <gerson.budke@ossystems.com.br>

diff --git a/src/Emulator/Peripherals/Peripherals/Analog/STM32C0_ADC.cs b/src/Emulator/Peripherals/Peripherals/Analog/STM32C0_ADC.cs
new file mode 100644
--- /dev/null
